abstract: >
  Code and data accompanying the paper
  “Routing representation and corridor choice for Europe–Asia trade via Suez, Cape and the Northern Sea Route”.
  The `ea_corridors` package reproduces all routing, distance, time, fuel, and CO₂ results reported in the manuscript,
  including GC vs sea-only A* baselines, distance deltas, corridor-typical speed scenarios, and sensitivity tests
  (endpoint and equal-speed).

